ion to support secure authentication and improved\nserver-side logic. Key changes include:\n\n- Added Logto as the OIDC provider with a dedicated PostgreSQL database.\n- Migrated URL scanning logic from client-side fetch to Next.js Server Actions.\n- Implemented JWT verification using ''jose'' and ''openid-client''.\n- Decoupled UI into Server (Navbar, Page) and Client (MainClientContainer) components.\n- Optimized Nginx buffers to handle large OIDC session cookies.\n- Added database initialization scripts and healthchecks for stable boot.","tree":{"sha":"6fe9044cc4fa7e8723a0d356e103bee432916455","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/trees/6fe9044cc4fa7e8723a0d356e103bee432916455"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/commits/ca916d6b40c06f44d7dfc10d5e5afdb7e00eac0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256149170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123","id":256149170,"login":"rizl123","node_id":"U_kgDOD0SGsg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123/seo_auditor/commit/ca916d6b40c06f44d7dfc10d5e5afdb7e00eac0b","node_id":"C_kwDOSBUPT9oAKGNhOTE2ZDZiNDBjMDZmNDRkN2RmYzEwZDVlNWFmZGI3ZTAwZWFjMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123/seo_auditor/commit/c12bd34a9d3f14bff7d67ce521508463c927379d","sha":"c12bd34a9d3f14bff7d67ce521508463c927379d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/commits/c12bd34a9d3f14bff7d67ce521508463c927379d"}],"sha":"ca916d6b40c06f44d7dfc10d5e5afdb7e00eac0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/commits/ca916d6b40c06f44d7dfc10d5e5afdb7e00eac0b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256149170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123","id":256149170,"login":"rizl123","node_id":"U_kgDOD0SGsg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/commits/c12bd34a9d3f14bff7d67ce521508463c927379d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T16:11:28Z","email":"rizl.sanding@proton.me","name":"rizl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T14:10:11Z","email":"rizl.sanding@proton.me","name":"rizl"},"message":"feat: implement structured error handling with Huma and frontend integration\n\nThis update integrates Huma''s RFC 7807-compliant error modeling on the\nbackend and provides a more robust, user-friendly error display on the\nfrontend.\n\n- Backend (Go):\n  - Switched to ''huma.Error400BadRequest'' and ''huma.Error500InternalServerError''\n    for standardized JSON error responses.\n  - Added strict URL validation (scheme and host check) before processing.\n  - Updated API router to explicitly document 400/500 error codes.\n  - Refined ''ScanInput'' tags to use Huma''s \"format: uri\" for automatic validation.\n\n- Frontend (Next.js):\n  - Created ''ApiErrorResponse'' interface to match Huma''s error structure.\n  - Improved error catching in ''Home'' page to extract specific error messages\n    from the API response body (message, detail, or title).\n  - Redesigned the error alert UI for better readability and visual hierarchy.\n  - Refactored loading skeletons into a separate component for cleaner code.","tree":{"sha":"3239922e2e7660dfb5f67d6936e95f5dc1f2c973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/trees/3239922e2e7660dfb5f67d6936e95f5dc1f2c973"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/commits/c12bd34a9d3f14bff7d67ce521508463c927379d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256149170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123","id":256149170,"login":"rizl123","node_id":"U_kgDOD0SGsg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123/seo_auditor/commit/c12bd34a9d3f14bff7d67ce521508463c927379d","node_id":"C_kwDOSBUPT9oAKGMxMmJkMzRhOWQzZjE0YmZmN2Q2N2NlNTIxNTA4NDYzYzkyNzM3OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123/seo_auditor/commit/524e9bf37199cd4455e2df66eb1768da53588bda","sha":"524e9bf37199cd4455e2df66eb1768da53588bda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/commits/524e9bf37199cd4455e2df66eb1768da53588bda"}],"sha":"c12bd34a9d3f14bff7d67ce521508463c927379d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/commits/c12bd34a9d3f14bff7d67ce521508463c927379d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256149170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123","id":256149170,"login":"rizl123","node_id":"U_kgDOD0SGsg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/commits/524e9bf37199cd4455e2df66eb1768da53588bda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T19:57:42Z","email":"rizl.sanding@proton.me","name":"rizl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T19:57:42Z","email":"rizl.sanding@proton.me","name":"rizl"},"message":"style(frontend): standardize typography and improve readability\n\nUpdated various report components to use consistent text sizing. Replaced\nmicro-typography (9px/10px) with `text-xs` (12px) across labels, badges,\nand metadata sections to improve accessibility and visual harmony.\n\n- DetailItem: Increased label and badge font size.\n- ProblemItem: Standardized \"How to fix\" and \"Docs\" headers.\n- ScannerSection: Scaled up issue badges, scan timestamps, and image labels.\n- Report: Updated target URL label sizing.","tree":{"sha":"cf6eb98ec5a188a09afb4365198a79fe61ae7fb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/trees/cf6eb98ec5a188a09afb4365198a79fe61ae7fb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/commits/524e9bf37199cd4455e2df66eb1768da53588bda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256149170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123","id":256149170,"login":"rizl123","node_id":"U_kgDOD0SGsg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123/seo_auditor/commit/524e9bf37199cd4455e2df66eb1768da53588bda","node_id":"C_kwDOSBUPT9oAKDUyNGU5YmYzNzE5OWNkNDQ1NWUyZGY2NmViMTc2OGRhNTM1ODhiZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123/seo_auditor/commit/2deb43dfd339f263adf0875b9c3fbeaa8c467770","sha":"2deb43dfd339f263adf0875b9c3fbeaa8c467770","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/commits/2deb43dfd339f263adf0875b9c3fbeaa8c467770"}],"sha":"524e9bf37199cd4455e2df66eb1768da53588bda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/commits/524e9bf37199cd4455e2df66eb1768da53588bda"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256149170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123","id":256149170,"login":"rizl123","node_id":"U_kgDOD0SGsg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/commits/2deb43dfd339f263adf0875b9c3fbeaa8c467770/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T19:38:37Z","email":"rizl.sanding@proton.me","name":"rizl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T19:38:37Z","email":"rizl.sanding@proton.me","name":"rizl"},"message":"feat(seo): enhance security and optimize HTML parsing\n\nHardened the backend against SSRF attacks and improved performance by\ntransitioning to a streaming HTML tokenizer.\n\n- Security: Implemented a secure HTTP client with pre-dial DNS resolution\n  and IP validation to block private/loopback address access.\n- Performance: Replaced goquery with native golang.org/x/net/html\n  streaming tokenizer, significantly reducing memory footprint.\n- Resilience: Added strict response body limits (512KB) and standardized\n  User-Agent to SiteInspector/1.0.\n- Dependencies: Removed github.com/PuerkitoBio/goquery and related\n  transitive dependencies.\n- Testing: Added comprehensive security and resilience tests for the\n  new infrastructure layer.","tree":{"sha":"72bd600cdbb5478695a878b3310edbd151a31912","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/trees/72bd600cdbb5478695a878b3310edbd151a31912"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/commits/2deb43dfd339f263adf0875b9c3fbeaa8c467770","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256149170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123","id":256149170,"login":"rizl123","node_id":"U_kgDOD0SGsg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123/seo_auditor/commit/2deb43dfd339f263adf0875b9c3fbeaa8c467770","node_id":"C_kwDOSBUPT9oAKDJkZWI0M2RmZDMzOWYyNjNhZGYwODc1YjljM2ZiZWFhOGM0Njc3NzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123/seo_auditor/commit/e372ef6eb297f32df8d7ee85d4c2c9e1127d94