ers/rizl123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/commits/c03b5d15f2cd54793939f2e99b3de6c47b61b1a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T13:00:31Z","email":"rizl.sanding@proton.me","name":"rizl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T13:00:31Z","email":"rizl.sanding@proton.me","name":"rizl"},"message":"feat(seo): refactor scan result details to structured slice and enhance frontend rendering\n\nRefactored the ScanResult details from a generic map[string]any to a\nstructured slice of Detail entities. This allows for typed data\nvisualization on the frontend, including support for specialized\nrendering of URLs, durations, badges, and images (e.g., OG previews).\n\nThe frontend has been modularized with new specialized components for\nreport rendering, improving maintainability and scannability of the\nSEO audit results.\n\nBackend:\n- Domain: Added DetailType enum and Detail struct.\n- DTO: Updated ScanResultDTO and implemented mapping logic.\n- Infra: Updated auditors to populate structured details.\n\nFrontend:\n- Types: Synchronized report types with backend.\n- Components: Extracted Card, DetailItem, ProblemItem, and ScannerSection.\n- Features: Added image rendering and specific formatters for data types.","tree":{"sha":"1e688a2be5180379621d5b6591e10a0186b300d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/trees/1e688a2be5180379621d5b6591e10a0186b300d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/commits/c03b5d15f2cd54793939f2e99b3de6c47b61b1a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer