s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rizl123","id":256149170,"login":"rizl123","node_id":"U_kgDOD0SGsg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rizl123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/commits/8cc1d22cc6ede4efb99530e453001416859c6b4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-05T13:06:16Z","email":"rizl.sanding@proton.me","name":"rizl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T10:19:17Z","email":"rizl.sanding@proton.me","name":"rizl"},"message":"feat(shared/cache): implement circuit breaker and resilient caching for SEO scanner\n\n- Refactor `NewApp` and `SetupCacher` to allow the application to start even if Redis is unavailable (Soft Bootstrap).\n- Introduce a Circuit Breaker mechanism in `CachedScanner` to temporarily disable caching after Redis errors.\n- Move cache `Store` operations to a background goroutine to prevent Redis latency from affecting response times.\n- Implement `shared.ErrCacheMiss` to explicitly distinguish between empty cache and connection failures.\n- Replace standard logging with `log/slog` for structured observability.\n- Update test suite to include circuit breaker logic and handle asynchronous storage with `assert.Eventually`.","tree":{"sha":"137c7f3a3176c826ee3c2b00df7b1017d40c92fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/trees/137c7f3a3176c826ee3c2b00df7b1017d40c92fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rizl123/seo_auditor/git/commits/8cc1d22cc6ede4efb99530e453001416859c6b4f","verification":{"payload":nu