hor":{"date":"2026-04-26T18:28:19Z","email":"victorvinci@gmail.com","name":"victor vinci"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T19:05:42Z","email":"victorvinci@protonmail.com","name":"Victor Vinci"},"message":"fix(release): create as draft so SBOM attaches on immutable-release repo\n\nGitHub''s \"Immutable releases\" setting locks a release the moment it''s\npublished. softprops/action-gh-release@v2''s default flow (create\nrelease first, upload assets second) hits a 422 on the asset step\nbecause by then the release is already locked.\n\nFollowing the action''s own error-message guidance: create as\ndraft: true with the SBOM in `files:` (assets attach while the\nrelease is still mutable as a draft), then flip draft→published\nin a follow-up step via `gh release edit --draft=false`.\n\nThe bug was hidden on rc.2 because rc.2 wasn''t actually marked as\nprerelease (the prerelease-flag fix only landed in rc.3) — non-\nprerelease releases on immutable-release repos take a different\nasset-upload path that doesn''t fail. rc.3 was the first run with\nthe prerelease flag on AND assets attached, so it surfaced first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: claude-opus-4-7","tree":{"sha":"3c37d145ced5e80d4bfcf327443ee5f2c0539254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/git/trees/3c37d145ced5e80d4bfcf327443ee5f2c0539254"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/git/commits/6d501729586cf02e431e4b2f4a2b53d0975ee865","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10777339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"