5e97190f6a86dd7ea8d678ae85e53ac82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/commits/f977c475e97190f6a86dd7ea8d678ae85e53ac82"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10777339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/victorvinci","id":10777339,"login":"victorvinci","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzc3MzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/commits/60e230a742255a39c812761818d1dd647ae917c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:53:48Z","email":"victorvinci@gmail.com","name":"victor vinci"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T18:23:06Z","email":"victorvinci@protonmail.com","name":"Victor Vinci"},"message":"fix(ci): make template rename self-test scan immune to its own rename\n\nThe inline scan in ci-scheduled.yml had two bugs that combined to\nmake it both miss real residuals and falsely flag itself:\n\n1. Self-rewriting patterns. ci-scheduled.yml IS in the rename\n   script''s pass-3 allowlist, so the test-rename rewrote the\n   inline grep pattern from `''steamdeck-webdev-template\\|@mcb/\n   \\|victorvinci''` to `''foo-fork\\|@acme/\\|alice''`. The scan then\n   matched its own test-invocation lines (--project-name foo-fork,\n   --github-owner alice) — guaranteed flag, no real signal.\n\n2. docs/UPGRADE.md intentionally references the upstream template\n   URL (`git remote add template git@github.com:victorvinci/\n   steamdeck-webdev-template.git`) so forks know how to track\n   upstream. It''s correctly NOT in the rename allowlist, but was\n   missing from the scan''s EXCLUDE regex — should have been\n   flagged as a true residual but the rewritten patterns missed it.\n\nExtracted the scan to scripts/scan-template-residuals.sh, which is\nNOT in any rename pass — its literal patterns survive. The new\nscript self-excludes via EXCLUDE, and adds docs/UPGRADE.md to the\nexclusion list (intentional upstream URL reference).\n\nCloses the failure mode that auto-filed issue #54.\n\nCo-Authored-By: claude-opus-4-7","tree":{"sha":"bdbc24affa251cae75334176492d630830486485","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/git/trees/bdbc24affa251cae75334176492d630830486485"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/git/commits/60e230a742255a39c812761818d1dd647ae917c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10777339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/victorvinci","id":10777339,"login":"victorvinci","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzc3MzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/repos","site_admin":fals