ithub.com/users/victorvinci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/commits/39019502136b2c908695d817328804200dd3e688/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T13:14:42Z","email":"victorvinci@gmail.com","name":"victor vinci"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T13:19:40Z","email":"victorvinci@protonmail.com","name":"Victor Vinci"},"message":"docs(release): use chore(release)/fix prefix for release+hotfix PR titles\n\n`release: X.Y.Z` and `hotfix: <slug>` both fail commitlint because\nneither `release` nor `hotfix` is in @commitlint/config-conventional''s\ntype-enum. Updated `docs/RELEASE.md` step 7 and the release/hotfix PR\ntemplates to use `chore(release): X.Y.Z` and `fix: <slug>` respectively.\n\n`chore(release):` matches the bump PR''s existing prefix so both\nrelease-flow PRs are filterable as one set. The \"hotfix\" intent is\nalready carried by the `hotfix/<slug>` branch name and template, so\nthe type can stay standard.\n\nCaught when PR #52 (`release: 0.3.0-rc.2`) hit the commitlint failure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: claude-opus-4-7","tree":{"sha":"61eb996a03052577d60f8ca142ae19e2b422ce6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/git/trees/61eb996a03052577d60f8ca142ae19e2b422ce6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/git/commits/39019502136b2c908695d817328804200dd3e688","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10777339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/