s://api.github.com/users/victorvinci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/commits/904bdfaca9b88fb67cc9d9d0bcbb9ada60e3d0d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T19:01:56Z","email":"victorvinci@gmail.com","name":"victor vinci"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T19:06:35Z","email":"victorvinci@protonmail.com","name":"Victor Vinci"},"message":"docs(release): drop Convert PR to Draft from required checks\n\nThe develop and main rulesets had `Convert PR to Draft` listed as a\nrequired status check, but the Force Draft workflow only fires on\n`pull_request_target` type `opened`. On synchronize (new push), the\ncheck has no run against the new head SHA, so it shows as\n\"Expected / Waiting\" forever and blocks the PR. Dropping it from the\nrequired list fixes that — the workflow still runs on opened PRs to\nsave CI minutes, it just isn''t a merge gate.\n\nUpdated the ruleset table in docs/RELEASE.md to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: claude-opus-4-7","tree":{"sha":"801a9fe5989c203ed6c720d745e8a0945902edc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/git/trees/801a9fe5989c203ed6c720d745e8a0945902edc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victorvinci/steamdeck-webdev-template/git/commits/904bdfaca9b88fb67cc9d9d0bcbb9ada60e3d0d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10777339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victorvinci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/victorvinci","id":10777339,"login":"victorvinci","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzc3MzM5","organizations_url":"ht