r_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/themmerich/monorepo-test/commits/8b08d5e4b8b03f1dc12afc59bb11404197d2ba11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T14:53:32Z","email":"t.hemmerich.extern@drgueldener.de","name":"Thomas Hemmerich"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T14:53:32Z","email":"t.hemmerich.extern@drgueldener.de","name":"Thomas Hemmerich"},"message":"feat: DDD lib structure with module boundaries; rename apps mfe1→cbs, mfe2→wau\n\nStructure:\n- libs/domain/provision (mfe:cbs): shell + feature-search/detail/edit +\n  feature-provisionsbezeichnungen/gebuehren/provisionstypen + data-access/ui/model\n- libs/domain/auswertung (mfe:wau): shell + feature-uebersicht + data-access/ui/model\n- Each lib tagged scope:<domain>, mfe:<name>, type:<layer>\n- Path aliases @monorepo-test/domain/<domain>/<lib>\n\nBoundaries enforced in eslint.config.mjs:\n- app:cbs/wau only depend on libs with matching mfe:* tag\n- Cross-domain and cross-MFE imports blocked (verified with negative test)\n- Layer hierarchy: shell → feature → ui/data-access/model → util\n\nApp rename:\n- apps/mfe1 → apps/cbs (+ e2e), apps/mfe2 → apps/wau (+ e2e)\n- Federation remote names, manifest keys, route paths, nav links all updated\n- Navbar labels \"Datenhaltung\"/\"Auswertungen\" unchanged; URLs /cbs, /wau\n- Layout component selector now app-provision-layout\n\nAlso: top topbar navigation rename (Datenhaltung/Auswertungen) from earlier\nin the branch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50925c3df16e800836377dd09c96b9b7b0083cf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/themmerich/monorepo-test/git/trees/50925c3df16e800836377dd09c96b9b7b0083cf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/themmerich/monorepo-test/git/commits/8b08d5e4b8b03f1dc12afc59bb11404197d2ba11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatar