onstypen\n- Add sidebar layout with expandable Definitionen submenu\n- Replace test-page exposure with MFE1_ROUTES exposed via federation\n- Standalone mfe1 reuses the same routes\n- Sidebar styled with Atruvia navy (#000064), inverted highlight on\n  active items\n\nshell:\n- Switch /mfe1 from loadComponent to loadChildren so the mfe1 subtree\n  mounts correctly under /mfe1/*\n- Replace text brand with Atruvia logo (svg), make it a link to /\n- Switch topbar to white background to match logo, navy active state\n- Reset html/body margin to remove unwanted vertical scrollbar\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"418f15683c3d58d374f61295d64febe07a585bfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/themmerich/monorepo-test/git/trees/418f15683c3d58d374f61295d64febe07a585bfd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/themmerich/monorepo-test/git/commits/0e776089bfa27c0ffe4d5b66c74a645aff595f96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3725151?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/themmerich","id":3725151,"login":"themmerich","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjUxNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich","user_view_ty