jUxNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/themmerich","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/themmerich/monorepo-test/commits/bae8439e63bfd707ab64400be649f42eabc351b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T18:41:46Z","email":"t.hemmerich.extern@drgueldener.de","name":"Thomas Hemmerich"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T18:41:46Z","email":"t.hemmerich.extern@drgueldener.de","name":"Thomas Hemmerich"},"message":"feat: set up shell + mfe1/mfe2 with native federation\n\nRestructures the workspace into a microfrontend architecture using\n@angular-architects/native-federation:\n\n- Rename monorepo-test app -> shell (dynamic-host, port 4200)\n- Add mfe1 (remote, port 4201) and mfe2 (remote, port 4202), each\n  exposing a simple TestPage standalone component via ./Component\n- Shell serves a plain HTML/CSS topbar navbar and lazy-loads the MFEs\n  through loadRemoteModule at /mfe1 and /mfe2, with a Home component\n  at /\n- federation.manifest.json points the shell at the two remote entries\n- npm scripts: start (all three parallel), start:shell/mfe1/mfe2,\n  plus matching build scripts\n- Explicit ports on the native-federation serve wrapper to avoid\n  collisions in parallel serve\n- Fix nx.json defaultBase: master -> main\n\nEach app builds independently to dist/apps/<name> with its own\nremoteEntry.json, enabling separate deployments.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d50b8d7a26c28971d020464dcb168769be6aaa17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/themmerich/monorepo-test