19:10:18Z","email":"j.romanczyk@gmail.com","name":"Jakub Romanczyk"},"message":"fix: bump zephyr-packages for native-cache JSI UAF fix\n\nPicks up fba9c04 which removes the legacy-bridge JSI install from\nzephyr-native-cache — the `RCTBridge currentBridge` /\n`javaScriptContextHolder.get()` pointer was unreliable under new-arch\nbridgeless and caused intermittent UAFs on bundle load / reload.\n\nAlso cleans up two stray peer-dep entries in pnpm-lock.yaml from the\nrebuild (no functional change).","tree":{"sha":"479ba68cff81f8572ad09541c12f7fd54ceab1ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZephyrCloudIO/zephyr-native-cache-test/git/trees/479ba68cff81f8572ad09541c12f7fd54ceab1ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZephyrCloudIO/zephyr-native-cache-test/git/commits/70a5ded05f386e208da1e4d63e40077644068426","verification":{"payload":"tree 479ba68cff81f8572ad09541c12f7fd54ceab1ae\nparent c12bc2ed24bbd0028a59918cf853b2bde000359c\nauthor Jakub Romanczyk <j.romanczyk@gmail.com> 1776453018 +0200\ncommitter Jakub Romanczyk <j.romanczyk@gmail.com> 1776453018 +0200\n\nfix: bump zephyr-packages for native-cache JSI UAF fix\n\nPicks up fba9c04 which removes the legacy-bridge JSI install from\nzephyr-native-cache — the `RCTBridge currentBridge` /\n`javaScriptContextHolder.get()` pointer was unreliable under new-arch\nbridgeless and caused intermittent UAFs on bundle load / reload.\n\nAlso cleans up two stray peer-dep entries in pnpm-lock.yaml from the\nrebuild (no functional change).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAhcAAAAHc3NoLXJzYQAAAAMBAAEAAAIBAMri98DSgXwy1mb0D9sBhH\nc1bNN/zVpRQYUjfBstVPR3J9NcTmwx4nV52c7Z1DxumgVXaHpZ5j/0uOTN0Z47Y1uI3hzy\nknhjM9bldIHM1hcb7t1dUFLJdV/OeX9ECXYT0qtsyJ7E/V4w+A/hUztfx95Jt7BHTwfha2\ntYx6G3boL2pf/lAdv8dFfKR83KQhlUxdnm4kmYj5TeZB1II9/VnzHtyPTMUKXhfhcP8SKC\n8qiLoXO9cRlUxGh4Aghhs8eZFAxJmSJTNh98g0HEa/lDDEAvZWa7CIa/S9TtEY8U11lWOD\nxdD2mHqD4HRHjFyvp/p6tTPSzn2CSiOGkiaIBP2Is0ZLnRNMtKN4E9q9VJkS0CgCtEccqb\nv5svfg9Lc