t> 한 줄로 단순화\n- blog Root.tsx: 하드코딩 login 경로 → pathname.endsWith(''/login'')\n\nhost\n- App.tsx: HostShell 단일 인스턴스, 인증 상태 분기는 children으로\n- lnb-items.tsx: buildLnbItems(user, isOwner) 함수로 mypage 동적 추가 통합\n- HostShell: children optional로 변경\n\nhooks\n- use-initialize: 중복 마운트 race condition 수정 (_initPromise 캐싱)\n- use-node-initialize: JSDoc 압축, 중첩 if → early return\n- 불필요 주석 전면 제거","tree":{"sha":"4aef87cf50e06d52c092cd88cbd220dcaf06fbe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ghtjd1358/Personal-Platform/git/trees/4aef87cf50e06d52c092cd88cbd220dcaf06fbe3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ghtjd1358/Personal-Platform/git/commits/6fec35f86b1b345e1b8ff7fc6ce2c3183d084e8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129839683?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ghtjd1358","id":129839683,"login":"ghtjd1358","node_id":"U_kgDOB70yQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ghtjd1358/Personal-Platform/commit/6fec35f86b1b345e1b8ff7fc6ce2c3183d084e8b","node_id":"C_kwDOSBh4edoAKDZmZWMzNWY4NmIxYjM0NWUxYjhmZjdmYzZjZTJjMzE4M2QwODRlOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ghtjd1358/Personal-Platform/commit/