bcdbe93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ghtjd1358/Personal-Platform/commits/75943cf24d3ac970b5d303e4adec6f1abbcdbe93"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129839683?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ghtjd1358","id":129839683,"login":"ghtjd1358","node_id":"U_kgDOB70yQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ghtjd1358/Personal-Platform/commits/08f0d5ec8791ee6f5851cdeb7e345dc887673372/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T13:38:05Z","email":"hojjang18@naver.com","name":"ghtjd1358"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T13:38:05Z","email":"hojjang18@naver.com","name":"ghtjd1358"},"message":"refactor(lib/host): 인터뷰 대비 코드 품질 개선 (Staff Engineer 9회 리뷰 → 9/10)\n\n[axios-factory]\n- factoryConfig/refreshState/axiosInstance → globalThis Symbol.for (MF dual-load 방어)\n- RefreshState ??= 모듈 로드 시 1회 초기화 (lazy re-creation race 제거)\n- subscribeTokenRefresh/onTokenRefreshed/onTokenRefreshFailed 모듈 스코프 격상\n- subscribeTokenRefresh: AbortSignal 지원, cleanup()으로 settle 시 리스너 누수 방지\n- abort reject → Axios.CanceledError (isCancel 시맨틱 보존)\n- onTokenRefreshFailed: Object.assign cause 보존\n- isRefreshing 원자적 check+set (rs 한 번만 읽어 await 이전에 set)\n- customRequestHandler: RequestConfig → InternalAxiosRequestConfig (_isRetry module augmentation)\n- AxiosHeaders.set() 사용, ServiceConfig 화이트리스트 spread, 에러 메시지 .slice(0,500)\n\n[use-supabase-auth]\n- roleCache → globalThis Symbol.for, TTL 만료 엔트리 즉시 evict\n- clearRoleCache() export, useSupabaseLogout에서 logout 시 호출\n- fetchProfileRole: 내부 AbortController로 외부 signal + 4s timeout 통합, .abortSignal() 사용\n- applySession(signal?): aborted 체크 후 dispatch\n- useSupabaseAuthSync: AbortController, SIGNED_IN 중복 가드 큐 내부로 이동\n\n[use-initialize]\n- useSupabaseInitialize: subscription을 effect 스코프 변수로 격상 (cleanup 할당 race 제거)\n- subscription 등록을 applySession 이전으로 이동 (applySession 실패 시도 구독 유지)\n- SIGNED_IN 중복 가드를 authQueue 람다 내부로 이동 (실행 시점 store 읽기)\n- ctrl.abort() + subscription?.unsubscribe() 직접 참조\n\n[AuthCallbackPage]\n- JWT client-side sub 검증 제거 (security theater, /auth/me가 source of truth)\n- batch() 제거 (React 19 automatic batching)\n\n[app-store]\n- dynamicReducers/localStore/hostCheckCached → globalThis Symbol.for\n- authMiddleware 추가 (logout 시 storage.clearAuth())\n\n[api-client]\n- _apiClient → globalThis Symbol.for, Proxy apply/set trap, WeakMap bound cache","tree":{"sha":"98dd41ec67f25389ee9489f53302deaa6836779b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ghtjd1358/Personal-Platform/git/trees/98dd41ec67f25389ee9489f53302deaa6836779b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ghtjd1358/Personal-Platform/git/commits/08f0d5ec8791ee6f5851cdeb7e345dc887673372","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129839683?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghtjd1358/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ghtjd1358","id":129839683,"login":"ghtjd1358","no