nt replaces ESLint. Recommended by\nSpeakeasy support as the correct fix for the OOM during Compile SDK.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0508b352571497f8a82a7ec1919e9a3411e0dfda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-1050710571/sdk/git/trees/0508b352571497f8a82a7ec1919e9a3411e0dfda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-1050710571/sdk/git/commits/974a540880a012c6ae95a1e37070d6a21f039eda","verification":{"payload":"tree 0508b352571497f8a82a7ec1919e9a3411e0dfda\nparent 63a3c4505bb9c9b228844a3cb81b64cd8cab0c24\nauthor Ismael <ismael@vercel.com> 1774573201 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774573201 -0600\n\nFix generation OOM: enable useTsgo and useOxlint in gen.yaml (#245)\n\nThe standard GitHub Actions runner has ~7GB RAM. Increasing the\nNODE_OPTIONS heap alone doesn''t help when the runner is constrained.\nSpeakeasy''s useTsgo replaces tsc with a Go-based transpiler (much\nlower memory), and useOxlint replaces ESLint. Recommended by\nSpeakeasy support as the correct fix for the OOM during Compile SDK.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpxdaRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFaAQAE8XedyWAMnG30tpYV7zom+J\nZUAH8V1MHeD7PEkau6TVZUSKcKIB0nfS78w2DmQqdfK3yrO8R1FpRvP/Uq8w88nb\nri6lpNRNUdnfgr1QLfP696iTkV4vYH7vw0e2BCI6KFM/gujIm3PPTAl7So7VKm9g\nGvQUjKANCjiAk7xIS9TVHD8+vE9Ekp1TBtAv2ZLplx66gZqijBBUC5S/PF16AxNK\nHnjau/TKw7P7ke2JhwANlMIpjdrmxcXX7Cmb3H6NEd4tZI3sQ2IgWNWiBQjFARVy\n4mbFvHyAG8GVp4yvfRtApbX9dLR7BPz6Je5qvOVV8klls4hNJ73OHi6AptYNvCQD\nnSu0yu44dh7pIHnge8PPIAHeA5XwyMsHLk9FrHbx5jpS3vH3fF3l+DVjG0Mhtu95\nYeG9Mze/jL9MD5xG44uFdgULcLI7LRV7v2COhARH4HpmXKXxu8eu7Jb22DBg0IKn\neiTF3gcHlFvdreFmWTUeJY0GpwTKnQw1JHf1nit8KBqC6r/ED6LyyOjciaMuTs99\nB+1KUJAM9OUk6uj3XBXIZj8Rtfb4eLiDkGBKsrlEZ8l/jKPbJD+1hQsPazHq1sdg\noi3BHqdvSFeFxCTSDwoyra5CyuibMzzth1aWIS2CPpxoMGYSetMC5AEBgCU/EmLC\nTs4Re/K9QxmFuH3Qzi6+\n=otCC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified