tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismaelrumzan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ismaelrumzan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-1050710571/sdk/commits/43e580a7b33e9ae0946a4057cceb50509b3a57a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T04:40:02Z","email":"ismael@vercel.com","name":"Ismael"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T04:40:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix generation: resolve updateFlagSegment name collision and increase heap (#231)\n\nTwo fixes for the SDK generation failures:\n\n1. Replace the redundant oneOf in updateFlagSegment response with a\n   direct $ref to components/Segment. The response schema had both an\n   inline Segment definition and a $ref to the same component, causing\n   duplicate Go type declarations in the mock server.\n\n2. Increase NODE_OPTIONS max-old-space-size from 6144 to 8192 MB for\n   the generation workflow, as TypeScript compilation now exceeds the\n   previous heap limit.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"5cfe091ab5dd6a724051ae8325ce7d1612ba14f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-1050710571/sdk/git/trees/5cfe091ab5dd6a724051ae8325ce7d1612ba14f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-1050710571/sdk/git/commits/43e580a7b33e9ae0946a4057cceb50509b3a57a0","verification":{"payload":"tree 5cfe091ab5dd6a724051ae8325ce7d1612ba14f4\nparent 084478d8df778881ca531636bb51a487e42d40fd\nauthor Ismael <ismael@vercel.com> 1772685602 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772685602 -0700\n\nFix generation: resolve updateFlagSegment name collision and increase heap (#231)\n\nTwo fixes for the SDK generation failures:\n\n1. Replace the redundant oneOf in updateFlagSegment response with a\n   direct $ref to components/Segment. The response schema had both an\n   inline Segment definition and a $ref to the same component, causing\n   duplicate Go type declarations in the mock server.\n\n2. Increase NODE_OPTIONS max-old-space-size from 6144 to 8192 MB for\n   the generation workflow, as TypeScript compilation now exceeds the\n   previous heap limit.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpqQkiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/CsQAJyTpNjEAllv9ftt0fXq5fkY\nlWXEIRNz9yGWkec4lsoUfpARka3zcEVoBzGdgs5qEVnREIELdxHjfapGIUOuOQDg\nyAre/pQ4k7KwMxqKNQeHtfshC7KcGxbsI4IrJ/J0f6luwFL7t3T5tiQPPB0IEPfX\nCvX+wbqkORb/yEFIqhhVvwCR/P3ixRTs5DFCEnaIFDcmDDPDdOPcgQnpxbDEmopm\nOc4ZtaNoCyN5qDxnO8Mqlh949ydFZqlUSFKtRWaXY1q9VNh4lfOktkiaTaoxXH3p\n/jIPbVeI4Sjy8KIwCHJaLolUqddZVTCYoVII3QW8W5gaMiXZwRdJFU546ieykwW8\nE8mtIeQYUYmGoTL8fiT6Fi4AJhzN58f1If2AmpzO6DoASf39Kc36uC+Gs5OIsVaI\ng6Hn+rcWdr7d+wfkL+Yn+XaiV4XpsKqlk1e26fmKYL3SG05MtWh5nghz5b/TKkwL\nAJ6VmRSL4BK401tMSSua+jjR1oxnmJWML6wLb5lQXg4A3zt03gL4gI5zZIGgoXdw\nYYpLAPvPlf0kRU6A8jKP3XmpnkphKS/Aoo3rFu9BO+P9Vy8kvlKNZJDZmBCb+I22\nnk4O2UkUjeh30M4PdlPvaks4q6oedNPamcuOHVfMJ/Mp73LKqAezK7iH1IsPvyvl\nhuw7smzCQufQDzHi0Z9i\n=ow2L\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-05T04:40:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https:/