:"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dataAnalysis2023","id":114172182,"login":"dataAnalysis2023","node_id":"U_kgDOBs4hFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dataAnalysis2023/si-como-app/commits/126197b7847a05064825c07729953a804869ba33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T06:04:37Z","email":"data.analysis2023@gmail.com","name":"Juan Diego Cardenas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T06:04:37Z","email":"data.analysis2023@gmail.com","name":"Juan Diego Cardenas"},"message":"docs: cierre de sesión 2026-04-15 — registro de avance y pendientes\n\nActualiza ESTADO.md con el detalle de la sesión larga (proteínas/bebidas,\nnavegación hoy/mañana, suite de tests, robustez de envío) y ROADMAP.md\nmarcando lo completado y registrando refinamientos detectados.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b284aa22e04dac37320e476720bcc476c077077","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dataAnalysis2023/si-como-app/git/trees/1b284aa22e04dac37320e476720bcc476c077077"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dataAnalysis2023/si-como-app/git/commits/126197b7847a05064825c07729953a804869ba33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114172182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dataAnalysis2023","id":114172182,"login":"dataAnalysis2023","node_id":"U_kgDOBs4hFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dataAnalysis2023/si-como-app/commit/126197b7847a05064825c07729953a804869ba33","node_id":"C_kwDOSB7az9oAKDEyNjE5N2I3ODQ3YTA1MDY0ODI1YzA3NzI5OTUzYTgwNDg2OWJhMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dataAnalysis2023/si-como-app/commit/385d9e7329e780fff17b3012f88880834355d1f5","sha":"385d9e7329e780fff17b3012f88880834355d1f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dataAnalysis2023/si-como-app/commits/385d9e7329e780fff17b3012f88880834355d1f5"}],"sha":"126197b7847a05064825c07729953a804869ba33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dataAnalysis2023/si-como-app/commits/126197b7847a05064825c07729953a804869ba33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114172182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dataAnalysis2023","id":114172182,"login":"dataAnalysis2023","node_id":"U_kgDOBs4hFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dataAnalysis2023/si-como-app/commits/385d9e7329e780fff17b3012f88880834355d1f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T06:02:47Z","email":"data.analysis2023@gmail.com","name":"Juan Diego Cardenas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T06:02:47Z","email":"data.analysis2023@gmail.com","name":"Juan Diego Cardenas"},"message":"feat: navegación hoy/mañana + proteínas/bebidas + historial + robustez envío\n\nCambios principales en esta sesión:\n\n- Reemplazo del menú recurrente libre por dos dimensiones:\n  proteínas y bebidas (multi-selección + nota libre opcional).\n- Mensajes WhatsApp reescritos con tono cálido para pareja que\n  comparte comida (multi-items con concordancia y emojis).\n- Botón \"Skip\" en el header con avance virtual a la siguiente comida.\n- Navegación por flechas entre comidas del día + día siguiente,\n  con label contextual (Hoy/Mañana/Ahora/Próximo).\n- Historial silencioso por slotKey (persiste selecciones, no consumo\n  — base para futura vista de hábitos con paso de confirmación).\n- Configuración: confirmación al eliminar comida, secciones\n  dedicadas para proteínas y bebidas.\n- Modal: pre-carga de selección previa al \"Cambiar aviso\",\n  empty states con CTA a Configuración, agregar inline con auto-select.\n- Envío WhatsApp: timeout 8s con AbortController, detección de\n  navigator.onLine, banner persistente de error con Reintentar +\n  link wa.me como fallback manual (limitación documentada: CORS\n  no-cors impide confirmación real de entrega).\n- Suite de tests nueva: Vitest + Testing Library (115 tests).\n- Convicción móvil registrada en memoria permanente del proyecto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"451087cf19e6b659c78e51e0e6b0b8b80b0f3ceb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dataAnalysis2023/si-como-app/git/trees/451087cf19e6b659c78e51e0e6b0b8b80b0f3ceb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dataAnalysis2023/si-como-app/git/commits/385d9e7329e780fff17b3012f88880834355d1f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114172182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dataAnalysis2023","id":114172182,"login":"dataAnalysis2023","node_id":"U_kgDOBs4hFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dataAnalysis2023","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dataAnalysis2023/si-como-app/commit/385d9e7329e780fff17b3012f88880834355d1f5","node_id":"C_kwDOSB7az9oAKDM4NWQ5ZTczMjllNzgwZmZmMTdiMzAxMmY4ODg4MDgzNDM1NWQxZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dat