sh201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/53436bcf0f2ec9bed9c8cc9c02c7936d1ca803b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:19:03Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Omprakash Gautam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:19:03Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Omprakash Gautam"},"message":"feat(transactions): split debit/credit in time picker cards\n\nPreviously the time picker cards showed a single \"spent\" number which\nwas actually withdrawalAmount + depositAmount — confusing when a month\nhad both inflow and outflow. Users couldn''t tell at a glance whether\n₹6.6L was money spent or money received.\n\nBackend:\n- DTO: replace spent: BigDecimal with debit + credit on YearAgg,\n  MonthAgg, WeekAgg\n- TransactionAggregateQuery: sum withdrawalAmount and depositAmount\n  separately in all three queries\n- TransactionService zero-fill helpers and TransactionServiceTest\n  constructors updated to pass both new arguments\n\nFrontend:\n- TS interfaces updated to debit + credit\n- YearPill: shows year + −₹debit (red) + +₹credit (green); each side\n  hidden when 0\n- MonthCard: stacks debit (red) and credit (green) as separate lines,\n  count below, total bar (debit + credit) at bottom; matches whatever\n  filter is active (Debit/Credit/All)\n- WeekCard: same stacked layout, compact\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68beaefdbd051995901df95be8b6fcd1996c4a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spen