4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/5b0a5df1a41aff7d088a2daee14c2888761e3cb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:59:02Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Omprakash Gautam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:59:02Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Omprakash Gautam"},"message":"feat(import): explain duplicates and link to existing record\n\nThe duplicate review queue now includes:\n- An inline explanation at the top: \"These transactions were skipped\n  because an identical record (same date, amount, and remarks) already\n  exists in your database from a previous import\"\n- A \"View existing →\" link on each duplicate row that opens the\n  Transactions page filtered to that date, so the user can find and\n  inspect the matching transaction\n\nNo backend change needed — the DuplicateEntry already has date and\namount, which is enough to locate the existing record.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha"