starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/9b6aa731fdd180ce45cf9862410242e5702c65f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T07:33:17Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Omprakash Gautam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T07:33:17Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Omprakash Gautam"},"message":"feat(ui): UI/UX polish — IBM Plex Sans, mobile filters, dark-mode fixes, a11y\n\n- Add IBM Plex Sans font (index.html + tailwind.config.js) for fintech-grade\n  typography across the entire app\n- LoginPage: fix error banner dark mode (red-900/30), add value prop bullets\n  to left panel, aria-label + focus-visible on password eye button\n- DashboardPage: alert bell aria-label includes live count, banner icons\n  wrapped in rounded-full circle backgrounds, StatCard gets active:scale-[0.98]\n  press feedback, chart tooltips adapt to dark/light mode via tooltipStyle(),\n  LoadingSkeleton upgraded to card-level fidelity (title stub + chart body)\n- Layout: sidebar slide uses motion-safe: prefix (respects prefers-reduced-motion),\n  nav section group headers get cursor-pointer + focus-visible ring\n- BottomNav: \"More\" button highlights blue when current route is not one of the\n  4 primary tabs (useLocation-based)\n- TransactionPage: secondary filters hidden behind collapsible \"Filters (N)\"\n  toggle on mobile (md+ always visible); refresh button gets aria-label +\n  focus-visible ring; clear-search button gets aria-label\n- BudgetPage + GoalsPage: amount inputs get inputMode=\"decimal\" for numeric\n  keyboard on iOS/Android\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8a1455787ce11194bbf34ed4ffd2bc4a8d4ae1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/gi