d":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/c50d6491b6e36683ec80d0c2bb88c6e9683b938c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T15:15:43Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Omprakash Gautam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T15:15:43Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Omprakash Gautam"},"message":"fix(pwa): add navigateFallbackDenylist to stop SW intercepting /api/ navigations\n\nThe Workbox navigation route was serving index.html for ALL navigation requests,\nincluding /api/oauth2/authorization/google. Clicking \"Sign in with Google\" loaded\nthe React SPA instead of the backend redirect — explaining \"nothing happens\".\n\nnavigateFallbackDenylist: [/^\\/api\\//] lets /api/ navigation requests pass\nthrough to the network so the 302->Google redirect works correctly.\n\nAlso removed the ^ anchor from the runtimeCaching regex so it matches full\nabsolute URLs (https://...) not just relative paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ae62370c89acd5c5db7820230adca6b06be5bfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/trees/0ae62370c89acd5c5db7820230adca6b06be5bfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/commits/c50d6491b6e36683ec80d0c2bb88c6e9683b938c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"u