_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/2bd970c548b8c0634c0478481bfd29c8ff6f7488/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T18:51:13Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Omprakash Gautam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T18:51:20Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Omprakash Gautam"},"message":"feat(auth): add Google OAuth2 login to SpendStack\n\n- Spring Security OAuth2 client with Google provider\n- OAuth2UserService: find-or-create user on first Google sign-in (auto-creates household as ADMIN)\n- OAuth2SuccessHandler: generates JWT after Google auth, redirects to /oauth2/callback?token=\n- OAuth2 endpoints moved under /api/ prefix so nginx proxies them without extra config\n- SessionCreationPolicy changed to IF_REQUIRED (needed for OAuth2 state param during redirect)\n- Liquibase migration 026: password_hash made nullable for Google-only accounts\n- JwtTokenProvider: added generateTokenForUser(User) for non-Authentication contexts\n- Frontend: OAuth2CallbackPage reads token from URL, fetches /api/auth/me, stores auth in Zustand\n- Frontend: \"Sign in with Google\" button on LoginPage\n- k8s: GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID/SECRET env vars added to backend deployment from spends-oauth2-secret\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1b8f90265ff0d3c0e0f33b4659fad624317c937","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/trees/b1b8f90265ff0d3c0e0f33b4659fad624317c937"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/commits/2bd970c548b8c0634c0478481bfd29c8ff6f7488","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}}