rs","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/6835ea5bdc756bc4169243a2660a3ad2cc304333/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T05:25:55Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T05:25:55Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"feat(categories): shareable bundle export/import with exclusion rules\n\nNew /api/categories/bundle/{export,import,preview} endpoints package\ncategories + per-category rules + descriptions + exclusions into one\nJSON file for sharing across households. Migration 025 adds\ncategory.description and category_rule.is_exclusion (both additive,\nbackwards-compatible). CategorizationService gains a two-pass match so\nexclusion rules suppress their target category; the empty-set fast path\nkeeps existing users'' behavior unchanged. Legacy /export and /import\nendpoints continue to work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b063016c15e4330c371349585ab276a0f998756","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/trees/3b063016c15e4330c371349585ab276a0f998756"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/commits/6835ea5bdc756bc4169243a2660a3ad2cc304333","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16777966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194/spends/commit/6835ea5bdc756bc4169243a2660a3ad2cc304333","node_id":"C_kwDOSB9op9oAKDY4MzVlYTViZGM3NTZiYzQxNjkyNDNhMjY2MGEzYWQyY2MzMDQzMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194/spends/commit/c3706ab32138d3142f0b1ba92c08d80b4e0e97b7","sha":"c3706ab32138d3142f0b1ba92c08d80b4e0e97b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/c3706ab32138d3142f0b1ba92c08d80b4e0e97b7"}],"sha":"6835ea5bdc756bc4169243a2660a3ad2cc304333","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/6835ea5bdc756bc4169243a2660a3ad2cc304333"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16777966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/c3706ab32138d3142f0b1ba92c08d80b4e0e97b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T18:29:46Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T18:29:46Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"feat(rules): group rules by category as one card with patterns as chips\n\nRules tab no longer shows one row per pattern. Instead, rule rows that share\n(categoryId, priority) are rendered as a single card with the patterns as\nremovable chips, plus an inline \"+ Add pattern\" affordance. Behind the\nscenes the schema and matching logic are unchanged — adding a chip POSTs\none /api/category-rules row, removing a chip DELETEs one, editing the\ncard''s category/priority PUTs every row in the group.\n\nThis collapses the duplication you''d hit with paytm + one97 → PayTM,\nebanking :first installment + ebanking :second installment → Education\nLoan, and similar — same rule, multiple OR-matched patterns.\n\nOther simplifications on the same tab:\n- Drop the redundant subtitle (\"Keywords matched against transaction\n  remarks — higher priority wins\"). The page header already says it.\n- Hide priority unless non-zero. The column was 0 on every row.\n- Move Export / Import behind a kebab menu — keep \"+ New Rule\" prominent.\n- Add a search box (auto-shown once you have >5 groups) that matches on\n  category name or pattern text.\n- New rule form takes multiple patterns at once (comma or Enter to add)\n  and creates one rule row per pattern in parallel.\n\nTransactionPage rule prompt now adapts wording when a rule for the chosen\ncategory already exists: \"Add {merchant} as a pattern to your existing\n{Category} rule?\" instead of \"Create a rule…\". Same backend call either\nway — the server creates a new row and the UI groups it visually.\n\nFrontend type-check + vite build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f56febfe8529510ac127a376b317e0512c165d0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/trees/f56febfe8529510ac127a376b317e0512c165d0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/commits/c3706ab32138d3142f0b1ba92c08d80b4e0e97b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16777966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194/spends/commit/c3706ab32138d3142f0b1ba92c08d80b4e0e97b7","node_id":"C_kwDOSB9op9oAKGMzNzA2YWIzMjEzOGQzMTQyZjBiMWJhOTJjMDhkODBiNGUwZTk3Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194/spends/commit/96aadaa4d8a925070e4bbba47cdc44929281f8f4","sha":"96aadaa4d8a925070e4bbba47cdc44929281f8f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/96aadaa4d8a925070e4bbba47cdc44929281f8f4"}],"sha":"c3706ab32138d3142f0b1ba92c08d80b4e0e97b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/c3706ab32138d3142f0b1ba92c08d80b4e0e97b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16777966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/96aadaa4d8a925070e4bbba47cdc44929281f8f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:36:47Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:36:47Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"feat(dashboard): redesign home as lifetime overview\n\nReframe the home page from \"this month at a glance\" to \"everything you''ve\never done\", matching the dashboard mockup.\n\nBackend\n- Two new TransactionRepository queries: bankBreakdown (per-bank total +\n  count) and yearlySpending (per-year withdrawal sum).\n- DashboardDto.Lifetime + nested records (LifetimeSummary, CategoryAmount,\n  BankActivity, MonthlyPoint, YearlyPoint).\n- DashboardService.getLifetime computes lifetime aggregates by reusing\n  earliestDate / latestTransactionDate / sumWithdrawals / sumDeposits /\n  countByUserId / categoryBreakdown across the full date span. Categories\n  go through the existing rollupToRoots so child-category spend collapses\n  to roots. Trend is the last 24 months anchored on the most recent month\n  with data, zero-filled for empty months.\n- GET /api/dashboard/lifetime — JWT, no params.\n- /api/dashboard/summary stays for the per-dashboard widget endpoint and\n  any external callers.\n\nFrontend\n- DashboardPage rewritten: 4 lifetime stat cards (transactions, total\n  amount, withdrawals, deposits) + earliest→latest date range, 2x2 chart\n  grid (category donut, bank horizontal bars, 24-month trend line, yearly\n  spending bars), then 2-column stats lists (top 8 categories, bank\n  activity).\n- Recurring patterns banner, savings-goals banner, alert bell + popover,\n  and AI insights sidebar all preserved.\n- inr() formatter extended with Cr suffix for crore-scale lifetime totals.\n- Dropped: month-anchored stat cards, per-month delta/comparison toggle,\n  account dropdown (lifetime view doesn''t filter by account), top-merchant\n  list (replaced by bank-activity list to match the mockup).\n- ALERT_META, AlertRow, inrCompact remain exported for AlertsPage.\n\n127 backend tests pass; frontend type-check + vite build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"126fc0b747405f3e99e266a0f83fe0d98d5dab2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/trees/126fc0b747405f3e99e266a0f83fe0d98d5dab2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/commits/96aadaa4d8a925070e4bbba47cdc44929281f8f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16777966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194/spends/commit/96aadaa4d8a925070e4bbba47cdc44929281f8f4","node_id":"C_kwDOSB9op9oAKDk2YWFkYWE0ZDhhOTI1MDcwZTRiYmJhNDdjZGM0NDkyOTI4MWY4ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194/spends/commit/5422af0e8f38a636c391fbd50c9fe30e65fddc06","sha":"5422af0e8f38a636c391fbd50c9fe30e65fddc06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/5422af0e8f38a636c391fbd50c9fe30e65fddc06"}],"sha":"96aadaa4d8a925070e4bbba47cdc44929281f8f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/96aadaa4d8a925070e4bbba47cdc44929281f8f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16777966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/commits/5422af0e8f38a636c391fbd50c9fe30e65fddc06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:31:38Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:31:38Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"feat(dashboards): dashboard filters, drag/resize, duplication, click-through\n\nWire the six TODO features for custom dashboards:\n\n- Migration 024 adds account_id/period_months/custom_from/custom_to to\n  dashboard, and grid_x/y/w/h to dashboard_widget (backfilled from existing\n  position so old widgets get a sensible 3-column layout).\n- WidgetService.resolveContext now derives effective (from, to, accountId)\n  by letting dashboard-level filters override widget-level filters when\n  set; widgets fall back to their own settings otherwise.\n- POST /api/widgets/{id}/duplicate, POST /api/dashboards/{id}/duplicate\n  (clones widgets too), POST /api/widgets/layout (batch grid coords),\n  PATCH /api/dashboards/{id}/filters.\n- DataSlice gains categoryId so chart click-through can build a transaction\n  filter by category.\n- Frontend uses react-grid-layout v2 (legacy export) for drag + resize,\n  debounced 500ms with diff-skip on no-op changes. FilterBar at the top of\n  DashboardDetailPage saves filters to the dashboard automatically.\n- WidgetRenderer accepts onSliceClick / onPointClick / onStatClick; the\n  detail page navigates to /transactions with effective category, date\n  range, account, and DEBIT/CREDIT type. TransactionPage seeds initial\n  filters from URL params on mount so the click-through actually filters.\n- Duplicate buttons land on widget cards, the detail-page header, and\n  dashboard list cards.\n\n127 backend tests pass; frontend type-check + vite build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c428081ce59289b322674babcd7a5ae66e7d22c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/trees/9c428081ce59289b322674babcd7a5ae66e7d22c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/commits/5422af0e8f38a636c391fbd50c9fe30e65fddc06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16777966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other