tter":{"date":"2026-04-29T04:12:04Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"feat(import): parse Kotak CSV transaction rows\n\nWalks records after the header row, treats any row whose col[0] is a\nnumeric integer string as a new transaction, parses date (d MMM yyyy\nEnglish locale), description, Chq/Ref, withdrawal, deposit, and\nbalance. Non-numeric col[0] rows (opening balance dash, page footers)\nare skipped silently for now; multi-line wrap and explicit\nend-of-statement termination are added in follow-up commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f198006e778c22ec0c37aee79db57d2e7139b017","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/trees/f198006e778c22ec0c37aee79db57d2e7139b017"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/commits/34d757014b1e8ffc61860cb58070a14bee8b1731","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16777966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/