mail.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T16:11:38Z","email":"omprakash201194@gmail.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"feat: export and import for categories and rules\n\n- GET /api/categories/export — downloads custom categories as JSON\n  (name, color, icon, parentName); only custom categories exported\n- POST /api/categories/import — multi-pass topological import so\n  children are created after their parents regardless of file order;\n  skips duplicates by name, reports created/skipped/errors\n- GET /api/category-rules/export — downloads user rules as JSON\n  (pattern, categoryName, priority)\n- POST /api/category-rules/import — looks up category by name,\n  skips duplicate patterns, reports result\n- Frontend: Export/Import buttons in Categories and Rules tab headers;\n  file picker reads JSON and POSTs to backend; result banner shows\n  created/skipped counts and any per-item errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"813123dd2e945004d99409391e3fc3fc60066f7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/trees/813123dd2e945004d99409391e3fc3fc60066f7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/commits/49ad3036c432a34486d267042709799be4942a26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16777966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","re