/dashboards/:id\n- Widget builder preview: Configure/Preview tabs in WidgetForm; preview\n  calls POST /api/widgets/preview (no save) to show live chart data\n- Chart type always editable: widgetType is now part of UpdateRequest so\n  users can change PIE→LINE etc on existing widgets\n- Chart type switcher in preview: try all 4 types before committing;\n  only the Configure tab selection is saved\n- Backend: Dashboard entity + migration 022 (seeds My Dashboard per user,\n  migrates orphan widgets); CustomDashboardController at /api/dashboards;\n  WidgetService.previewWidget builds temp widget without persisting\n- Tests: WidgetServiceTest and WidgetControllerTest updated for new signatures\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8f71e8ac2cc7f5ab5478c30f7d598dbf352fb66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/trees/a8f71e8ac2cc7f5ab5478c30f7d598dbf352fb66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omprakash201194/spends/git/commits/553a00f272ad79eb13fc860a8dca6247eb993058","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16777966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omprakash201194","id":16777966,"login":"omprakash201194","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzc3OTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omprakash201194/starred{/owner}{/rep