ODdkM2Y2MTE2ZDM4YmYxMDVhMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhishekingle662/Personal-ecosystem/commit/b9da362beb8a08a1db45354b18c77a33b3757f6c","sha":"b9da362beb8a08a1db45354b18c77a33b3757f6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhishekingle662/Personal-ecosystem/commits/b9da362beb8a08a1db45354b18c77a33b3757f6c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhishekingle662/Personal-ecosystem/commit/721c4977934883fab01003f7db56249a0e440612","sha":"721c4977934883fab01003f7db56249a0e440612","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhishekingle662/Personal-ecosystem/commits/721c4977934883fab01003f7db56249a0e440612"}],"sha":"dd5f3de17cf99f6da3bd87d3f6116d38bf105a20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhishekingle662/Personal-ecosystem/commits/dd5f3de17cf99f6da3bd87d3f6116d38bf105a20"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89772491?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhishekingle662/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhishekingle662/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhishekingle662/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhishekingle662/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhishekingle662","id":89772491,"login":"Abhishekingle662","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NzcyNDkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhishekingle662/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhishekingle662/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhishekingle662/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhishekingle662/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhishekingle662/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhishekingle662","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhishekingle662/Personal-ecosystem/commits/721c4977934883fab01003f7db56249a0e440612/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T09:32:09Z","email":"abhishekingle662@gmail.com","name":"ABHISHEK NANDKUMAR INGLE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T09:32:09Z","email":"abhishekingle662@gmail.com","name":"ABHISHEK NANDKUMAR INGLE"},"message":"feat: initial micro-os monorepo implementation\n\nTurborepo + pnpm workspace with 7 apps and 5 shared packages.\n\nApps (all lazy-loaded routes within apps/dashboard):\n- dashboard: OS shell, ⌘K command palette, PWA, activity feed, stats\n- job-tracker: Kanban board with @dnd-kit drag-and-drop, detail drawer,\n  AI interview coach, analytics view (Recharts funnel + bar charts)\n- email-composer: inbox list, AI draft generation (2 variants), tone selector\n- linkedin-gen: idea generator, post editor with live preview, content library\n- journal: daily entries, mood tracking, AI reflection prompts, mood trend chart\n- habits: daily/weekly habit tracking, streak calculation, AI encouragement\n- snippets: code library with Fuse.js fuzzy search, copy/export\n\nPackages:\n- @micro/ui: shadcn-style components on Radix UI primitives, Tailwind v4,\n  Geist font, dark-mode design tokens\n- @micro/storage: Dexie.js schema (emails, jobs, posts, journal, habits,\n  snippets, ai_cache), typed hooks with Fuse.js search, globalSearch(),\n  seed data (3 jobs, 2 emails, 1 LinkedIn draft, 2 habits)\n- @micro/ai: tiered LLM client (Ollama → Groq → claude-haiku-3-5-20241022),\n  SHA-256 prompt cache in IndexedDB with 24h TTL, useAI() hook\n- @micro/data-bus: BroadcastChannel wrapper with same-tab CustomEvent\n  fallback, useBusEvent() hook\n- @micro/config: shared tsconfig.base.json (strict), eslint.config.base.js,\n  tailwind.config.base.ts with design tokens\n\nAll 11 packages pass turbo run typecheck. Dev server serves HTTP 200.\nn8n integration points stubbed with typed payload shapes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ona <no-reply@ona.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb3c1c3cf05c4597fdf025bbe336844c5ebcd75b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhishekingle662/Personal-ecosy