":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-shared-state/commits/9aaa04ab4f7d50fc0f5b361d605e4bd1aa7ef25f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T08:27:27Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T08:27:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add shared CoursePhase/Participation provider (#66)\n\nThe shared getCoursePhase / getCoursePhaseParticipations queries live\nhere, but each phase pushes their results into a locally defined store.\nAdd a CoursePhaseProvider (context) built on the existing\nuseGetCoursePhase + useGetCoursePhaseParticipants hooks, exposing\ncoursePhase and participations (plus combined pending/error/refetch) so\nphases stop re-implementing the store. Addresses the standing TODO in\nconfigService.ts.\n\nCloses #58","tree":{"sha":"8b423dddca24df63aea92cbff8279fb44a9a913c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-shared-state/git/trees/8b423dddca24df63aea92cbff8279fb44a9a913c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-shared-state/git/commits/9aaa04ab4f7d50fc0f5b361d605e4bd1aa7ef25f","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b423dddca24df63aea92cbff8279fb44a9a913c\nparent 34655518da2bc461dc9e1ad16b6d8958d42415a9\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1786523247 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786523247 +0200\n\nAdd shared CoursePhase/Participation provider (#66)\n\nThe shared getCoursePhase / getCoursePhaseParticipations queries live\nhere, but each phase pushes their results into a locally defined store.\nAdd a CoursePhaseProvider (context) built on the existing\nuseGetCoursePhase + useGetCoursePhaseParticipants hooks, exposing\ncoursePhase and participations (plus combined pending/error/refetch) so\nphases stop re-implementing the store. Addresses the standing TODO in\nconfigService.ts.\n\nCloses #58","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfC5vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAt8QQAJ3TWge5R8VrbIHPdV/J2wUC\njmA9i3bqHkcsiUE2gnzN/kaNafZx4roZo9qi9z7/QxUdhJh0mR7rrg2dTsPdT14M\nnRjyoWKJtGUJsjvpZX586Ltv3T3bi0YtkuNd4Jg0uDMdo5uAZMrP8vfAgmTMxUfk\nDHrxnNFJS0UiIxPk8scwvmFMS2K/s186iT00PtaKpw6eSMl+1acbbcD/ESnAXhzb\n62TdQunfYeas92C0tL5FVKG4Z5qCvUbnhQlJndBtLl1MGbnxktb+uba30FCZCl9S\nY6J430cwiTTJgs/vIDPBMDbCXcXOXXcB0+A/0wTMHVeN4NKNFzCvd0wbopuXUwTT\nvOhvXybqeq3nrm16enAbK+SXKhjNUt+3ATR3ezsN3vbZ3WCG10GqQtR5xhJ889bb\n9cr5uAIxkfvbb7jhH+9Wp/I2A7klLNCmswEIsHtcxXwTsmvuVTkdX0uWdpY8VkYt\nrRzudULFCRlKvTRT6kLXo7uzOLWwoBWbeI9aYW7ToArJxG2PbHV6DuI/dxJPMunB\nSv3ACMCrM2cgC/GyRf1m+n/TvfDsN79Kl09nUEvJu2sCWmgHNip8ysKCFUNrGtT8\nk5VoVRnpySV33sv7A4O1fv1MrAnOQlGtJ8UFO3R2EhyjwG4UM1MAE38Tv95LDsxI\nKiTOtquJBGF3geRxK+2Z\n=s6rK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-12T08:28:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https: