ithub.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T08:27:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add shared request error handling for the phase axios instances (#65)\n\nAttach a response interceptor to the shared axios instances that logs\nvia the existing logNetworkError (sanitized) and rethrows. This lets the\n~130 network call sites drop their identical try/console.error/rethrow\nwrapper without changing their signatures.\n\nCloses #59","tree":{"sha":"1338572448b69888ad07b2e63633783841c61d22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-shared-state/git/trees/1338572448b69888ad07b2e63633783841c61d22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-shared-state/git/commits/34655518da2bc461dc9e1ad16b6d8958d42415a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 1338572448b69888ad07b2e63633783841c61d22\nparent b720dc3e34f1cceeb56c6ee38e6b6c20e820ed1f\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1786523231 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786523231 +0200\n\nAdd shared request error handling for the phase axios instances (#65)\n\nAttach a response interceptor to the shared axios instances that logs\nvia the existing logNetworkError (sanitized) and rethrows. This lets the\n~130 network call sites drop their identical try/console.error/rethrow\nwrapper without changing their signatures.\n\nCloses #59","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfC5fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEJwQABS8N8scIU4skHozfHQ3YL3I\n3GeNl+By8r/CNj7u0LgOw+wVI//JVNuEDZPzqKjnBbDE5fxytnqd+j7MC78AUZa4\noz9lFb+DPl8XjDB3B+DCxY/7fzRndaefoGR+TTMzwRKDQr/zw5kg8KJ7m8TPoJ8C\nxNmjOvRgYYZzCRDKc8U8Gus75u7MSPNF37qnthTF61g6IFJOKXqFNByZ2oBpJA9S\nD9xDbWRCB2ss0GIcb7oFLg6FcWRUTPwBjmDMux6sGk/u/PByZp7WuZV6WejDMZGJ\nmanu6o34Q3YjILSZTD9WCzXXND5COFBMNqgLAInFkobDGGRC17AJxSwt79o+GiRZ\nHGu/b64n5qbRPBnXHqQfeU5UbYl+UtE6ljdEdzl3/DiDnXOko6hXhEE5rpTyxaLx\nubpHWVv8dfFpD+8QwF1CmymY/eVroJZh64qL4ndzUUq/1t+vjeVxLKkYtDvEy8