{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rappm","id":53191688,"login":"rappm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTkxNjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-shared-state/commits/83f736d357a3b56b89ad4ac302e4ea342c5cdd82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T15:33:27Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T15:33:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add createAuthenticatedAxiosInstance factory (#64)\n\nEvery phase micro-frontend re-creates the same authenticated axios\ninstance, differing only by the env host key. Add a factory that builds\nan instance with the shared Bearer-token request interceptor and a\nper-phase base host, so each phase stops declaring its own. The CORE\naxiosInstance now delegates to it. The existing Patch interface stays\nexported so the local copies in the phases can be dropped.\n\nCloses #57","tree":{"sha":"3f4274e527359a47f4c5048f40b4ebb1cd8d8828","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-shared-state/git/trees/3f4274e527359a47f4c5048f40b4ebb1cd8d8828"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-shared-state/git/commits/83f736d357a3b56b89ad4ac302e4ea342c5cdd82","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f4274e527359a47f4c5048f40b4ebb1cd8d8828\nparent f3ddf06e4c64591a43a7cc370bcacaa901a68f88\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1786462407 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786462407 +0200\n\nAdd createAuthenticatedAxiosInstance factory (#64)\n\nEvery phase micro-frontend re-creates the same authenticated axios\ninstance, differing only by the env host key. Add a factory that builds\nan instance with the shared Bearer-token request interceptor and a\nper-phase base host, so each phase stops declaring its own. The CORE\naxiosInstance now delegates to it. The existing Patch interface stays\nexported so the local copies in the phases can be dropped.\n\nCloses #57","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqe0DHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWmwQAAErMbzKatU5OAccg6lw3QY3\nzNQHHGlVEBzE1n9See/webDOBPfoOta2MV4/zVPfDY4mswwBgM23dKLxBVPg0OPL\nfzVGgVzv+ljaPUd+capnzNRFZ/xOkt9gONK8jq6gjNq4Z6rujnwVSBHupO1bcGPr\nyZW5U+M0ETLMYbvps2tvOLS//0nqOQlBy2xV066bq8FW8tVKcqdohUlQm+uo7LT5\n9wx/FOOC5xF3WL5SpXPnE6NFCRzeQXK323LWHvKJuuPRGz0U8lYMDB+OqW7kOPtv\nt8pM8zEoonbhNkkQSOHgbMQGJRftE+Nn5peWdfcAY3I4E7G5dNbnfaVBCe7oY/eI\nDmwSLXXSkL9ida8BvH7xKhki5uB14yLNxEwxSpTbIudLmcAX4yMbU5ygoUj4IOS+\ndYbunKgofgnZnSfR7GNx0nXsidQyNF3KcMkQcr2i2Sl6ctA0chlIRtMZZQkNxOya\nblMWdF5+R7jGYLz6UgmcA0/KnAWkNPyjwP6Hw1CtalWf4iXoyH7I4Bk418Z7DLUN\nELhl/bWGrr8qXo5PyvUM0zQJ2rbY4KaUBzlJtF2XyJ+a5rHlf1WqaCL2qjt/mK73\nek+cqrgsdAFszsICzpaOVEfpNqMKl1QhcfYXrtjrdRSqRBDnNKGZdQUz+IaxpxE9\nh7FCVa5/fses0l3mAHZx\n=e1l1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-11T15:35:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id