/api.github.com/users/rappm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rappm","id":53191688,"login":"rappm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTkxNjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-shared-state/commits/d9fec5bdca1f72e8274bd39a2a353ddcfab4afad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T08:30:50Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T08:30:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Extract shared state hooks and queries for course phase workflows (#17)\n\n* feat: add environment configuration and various hooks for course phase management\n\n- Created `src/env.ts` for environment variable declarations.\n- Added hooks for file upload, course phase retrieval, and modification:\n  - `useFileUpload` for handling file uploads with progress tracking.\n  - `useGetCoursePhase` to fetch course phase data.\n  - `useGetCoursePhaseParticipants` to retrieve participants for a specific course phase.\n  - `useGetMailingIsConfigured` to check mailing configuration status.\n  - `useModifyCoursePhase` for modifying course phase details.\n  - `useUpdateCoursePhaseMetaData` for updating course phase metadata with optimistic updates.\n  - `useUpdateCoursePhaseParticipation` for updating participation status with rollback on error.\n  - `useUpdateCoursePhaseParticipationBatch` for batch updates of participation statuses.\n- Introduced routing interfaces for extended route objects and sidebar menu items.\n- Implemented utility functions for file size formatting, country retrieval, Gravatar URL generation, and status color mapping.\n- Developed network services for handling API requests related to course phases and file uploads.\n- Added translations for university-related strings and regex patterns.\n\n* feat: reorganize dependencies and peerDependencies in package.json\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>\n\n* feat: enhance environment handling and error logging across network operations\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>\n\n* feat: add peerDependencies for React and React Router in yarn.lock\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5bb83cd97be8cb79d4bf6404aaefaff6440b67e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-shared-state/git/trees/e5bb83cd97be8cb79d4bf6404aaefaff6440b67e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-shared-state/git/commits/d9fec5bdca1f72e8274bd39a2a353ddcfab4afad","verification":{"payload":"tree e5bb83cd97be8cb79d4bf6404aaefaff6440b67e\nparent b8a8598e9d0bb1ec0287557d111e367929a7b81a\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1776933050 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776933050 +0200\n\nExtract shared state hooks and queries for course phase workflows (#17)\n\n* feat: add environment configuration and various hooks for course phase management\n\n- Created `src/env.ts` for environment variable declarations.\n- Added hooks for file upload, course phase retrieval, and modification:\n  - `useFileUpload` for handling file uploads with progress tracking.\n  - `useGetCoursePhase` to fetch course phase data.\n  - `useGetCoursePhaseParticipants` to retrieve participants for a specific course phase.\n  - `useGetMailingIsConfigured` to check mailing configuration status.\n  - `useModifyCoursePhase` for modifying course phase details.\n  - `useUpdateCoursePhaseMetaData` for updating course phase metadata with optimistic updates.\n  - `useUpdateCoursePhaseParticipation` for updating participation status with rollback on error.\n  - `useUpdateCoursePhaseParticipationBatch` for batch updates of participation statuses.\n- Introduced routing interfaces for extended route objects and sidebar menu items.\n- Implemented utility functions for file size formatting, country retrieval, Gravatar URL generation, and status color mapping.\n- Developed network services for handling API requests related to course phases and file uploads.\n- Added translations for university-related strings and regex patterns.\n\n* feat: reorganize dependencies and peerDependencies in package.json\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>\n\n* feat: enhance environment handling and error logging across network operations\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>\n\n* feat: add peerDependencies for React and React Router in yarn.lock\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp6di6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0PsQAE5jmn+J0ciiqoeJ2eRePmSt\nMhnNH9gYA39dcnR32qqzPwq0ke8/cxkul4nR1s2eqgyuLPLYvK+GC2tXAQ7+ybjh\ngx9TA3m0OrZNEAaX3e9iH08i9TmPk7eLOmDsDsa6qldUb3HhmitmrktanAGaYUlI\n6gsIZV5L5bm3NvdfQUWibKlIrI8qO+ocCWnWvDuK4vg+TWTrLyzfHBuF116+FHkP\nyuVt8Z7clLCyJqOl6AtDkB4a+WtDk+vOvdZrFlf4oE5aSLrpsqCPEGgShMMPBY4g\nlD3HFu5PUJ5Ul7ddqncbvrvRmdV89yaLmk7krx2N7LSbLgzKyA/jt40DWTs3Kx7j\n4j9xKaDcnx13hOR1l9Noe8QqAqlGZ0MZfMYX5+IuSn1mvHLsZwEjxX0AbiZQRl6D\nJTRh2erxOLWMk0qzskPybW3Io0oZYK8Wa1R0hQuKsDl4r5xsmBslWyKQHg8EPwym\n80Xl4LaPMAwndFsQ1yft3q7H/mR0uAB6zrPvybIx30dpv/AwaXDVQ/lvo3qS9QNR\nqDdCFObQyAwjujPCmGRP0rkCGudn1MqQOAvDofjLwNUdqMjqljCIBNCwWRp9dVGl\nxJOsd/OiyWNRCSl4Ie/a9NhsuUTHTAVytncvwbLyw2BPh5mnyEeUnYGjubat+MDf\ntAKnT1qo+rN9N3Fki20R\n=8xJU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-23T08:30:50Z"}},"comm