GraphQL client; creates Railway project, tries\n  to attach Postgres + services linked to the GitHub repo (service-\n  creation mutation still flaky on latest Railway schema; falls back\n  gracefully so project+repo still succeed).\n- stage6-deploy.ts: orchestrates github push → railway project. Skips\n  cleanly when GITHUB_TOKEN / GITHUB_OWNER / RAILWAY_TOKEN absent.\n- runner: adds 7th stage \"deploy\" after \"validate\", 10min timeout.\n- Dashboard: shows live app URL card with frontend/backend/github/\n  railway links once deploy stage finishes.\n- gemini client: adds maxOutputTokens=32k, lenient JSON extractor that\n  salvages the largest top-level { ... } block when Gemini sneaks prose\n  around the response.\n- Codegen model switched from gemini-2.5-pro → gemini-2.5-flash (5-10x\n  faster, sufficient for constrained prompts).\n- stage3-rag prompt: target stack is now React + FastAPI + SQLAlchemy +\n  PostgreSQL (Railway-compatible). No Firebase, no credentials JSON,\n  backend reads DATABASE_URL from env.\n\nVerified end-to-end with library.xml:\n  Generate: 31 files, engine=gemini, outputDir populated\n  Deploy:  GitHub repo created + pushed (31 files)\n           Railway project created\n           Postgres plugin / services: skipped (schema mismatch, TODO)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6edefd4f73d4e7cf9f4a5282cb75f80eeac15dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/git/trees/e6edefd4f73d4e7cf9f4a5282cb75f80eeac15dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/git/commits/0f79896f38c7dbd4e76e189e18266459e9465417","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132346796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamThaok","id":132346796,"login":"AdamThaok","node_id":"U_kgDOB-NzrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/commit/0f79896f38c7dbd4e76e189e18266459e9465417","node_id":"C_kwDOSCNDrtoAKDBmNzk4OTZmMzhjN2RiZDRlNzZlMTg5ZTE4MjY2NDU5ZTk0NjU0MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/commit/e7aec6d7a7d8d9036a5219947e9bbeaabe0823f6","sha":"e7aec6d7a7d8d9036a5219947e9bbeaabe0823f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/commits/e7aec6d7a7d8d9036a5219947e9bbeaabe0823f6"}],"sha":"0f79896f38c7dbd4e76e189e18266459e9465417","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/commits/0f79896f38c7dbd4e76e189e18266459e9465417"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132346796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamThaok","id":132346796,"login":"AdamThaok","node_id":"U_kgDOB-NzrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/commits/e7aec6d7a7d8d9036a5219947e9bbeaabe0823f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T16:21:54Z","email":"adamm3002@gmail.com","name":"adamm3002@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T16:21:54Z","email":"adamm3002@gmail.com","name":"adamm3002@gmail.com"},"message":"Enhance Gemini prompt for non-technical user onboarding\n\n- stage3-rag prompt now demands emitted projects include:\n  * SETUP.md with click-by-click Firebase + Docker Desktop instructions\n  * run.sh + run.bat one-click launchers\n  * scripts/check-setup.{sh,bat} that verify Docker + credentials file\n    present before starting compose, with friendly error messages\n  * seed.py for sample data (idempotent, derived from OPM objects)\n  * Clear stacktrace-free errors when firebase-credentials.json missing\n- runner timeout raised to 300s — Gemini 2.5 Pro takes longer on the\n  expanded prompt with 35+ file emission.\n\nVerified end-to-end: library.xml → 37 files, 100% OPM coverage, 0 iters.\nEmitted SETUP.md is readable by a non-dev: \"Install Docker Desktop\",\n\"Add project\", \"Generate new private key\", \"Rename to\nfirebase-credentials.json\", \"sh run.sh\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfa3ee5e4827a3179ea12ca6dc8d44cdf48325d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/git/trees/dfa3ee5e4827a3179ea12ca6dc8d44cdf48325d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/git/commits/e7aec6d7a7d8d9036a5219947e9bbeaabe0823f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verifi