ar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamThaok","id":132346796,"login":"AdamThaok","node_id":"U_kgDOB-NzrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/commits/7f231bf8be4ec6a7843fd5b282bff5b425748638/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T15:48:38Z","email":"adamm3002@gmail.com","name":"adamm3002@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T15:48:38Z","email":"adamm3002@gmail.com","name":"adamm3002@gmail.com"},"message":"Fix Gemini model names + disk-backed job store\n\n- Use gemini-2.5-flash (text/vision) + gemini-2.5-pro (codegen).\n  Prior names (gemini-2.0-flash-exp, gemini-1.5-flash) were 404 on\n  the current API. Verified via ListModels against live key.\n- Move job store from in-memory Map to <tmp>/opm-jobs/<id>.json.\n  Survives Next.js HMR restarts during dev so the dashboard never\n  sees \"job not found\" after a code edit. Same interface; stages\n  still flush on every updateStage call.\n\nEnd-to-end verified: library.xml → 28 real generated files, 1\nrefinement iteration, 100% OPM coverage, downloadable zip works.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"64b681a4c60169ee8bc94daf81346f60f65a0f15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/git/trees/64b681a4c60169ee8bc94daf81346f60f65a0f15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/git/commits/7f231bf8be4ec6a7843fd5b282bff5b425748638","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132346796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamThaok","id":132346796,"login":"AdamThaok","node_id":"U_kgDOB-NzrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/commit/7f231bf8be4ec6a7843fd5b282bff5b425748638","node_id":"C_kwDOSCNDrtoAKDdmMjMxYmY4YmU0ZWM2YTc4NDNmZDViMjgyYmZmNWI0MjU3NDg2Mzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/commit/0b679b0f321422bd17f0081efe6f9a4f6db42be9","sha":"0b679b0f321422bd17f0081efe6f9a4f6db42be9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/commits/0b679b0f321422bd17f0081efe6f9a4f6db42be9"}],"sha":"7f231bf8be4ec6a7843fd5b282bff5b425748638","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/commits/7f231bf8be4ec6a7843fd5b282bff5b425748638"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132346796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamThaok","id":132346796,"login":"AdamThaok","node_id":"U_kgDOB-NzrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/commits/0b679b0f321422bd17f0081efe6f9a4f6db42be9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T15:28:58Z","email":"adamm3002@gmail.com","name":"adamm3002@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T15:28:58Z","email":"adamm3002@gmail.com","name":"adamm3002@gmail.com"},"message":"Wire real Gemini pipeline (single-AI mode) with refinement loop\n\n- lib/llm/gemini.ts: thin @google/generative-ai wrapper (askText,\n  askJson, askMultimodal, askMultimodalJson). Used by every stage.\n- stage1-parse: when GOOGLE_API_KEY is set, Gemini reads uploaded\n  file bytes (image via vision, XML/JSON inline) and emits canonical\n  OPM IR JSON. Falls back to mock variant on failure.\n- stage2-spec: Gemini converts OPM IR → domain model + API + screens\n  + business rules, with traceability back to OPM ids.\n- stage3-rag: skip Pinecone entirely in single-AI mode. Inline ISO\n  19450 distilled rules, ask Gemini to compose a strict super-prompt\n  that references every entity/endpoint and demands { files: [...] }\n  response format from stage 4.\n- stage4-codegen: Gemini emits real files. Runner writes them to\n  os.tmpdir()/opm-out-<jobId>/, threads outputDir onto JobState.\n- stage5-validate: real refinement loop. Static checks (required\n  files present, non-empty), coverage check (every OPM id mentioned\n  somewhere in emitted code). If gaps, call Gemini with a fix-prompt;\n  patch in-place; recheck. Up to 2 iterations. Records refinementLog.\n- runner.ts: longer timeout (180s) for Gemini calls, reduced retry to\n  1 attempt, patches outputDir onto job after stage 4.\n- download route: if outputDir exists, streams live zip via archiver\n  from the real project directory. Falls back to bundled scaffold\n  when mock mode or dir missing.\n- jobs.ts: adds patchJob() helper; types.ts adds optional outputDir.\n- public/samples/library.xml: sample OPCloud-style OPM model for\n  end-to-end testing (library domain: Member, Book, Loan, Reservation,\n  Fine with state transitions).\n\nWhen GOOGLE_API_KEY is blank, pipeline silently falls back to mock\nmode so the demo keeps working without keys.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f0da5d9cbbdb2771005f4581f25a5b60c13aed1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/git/trees/3f0da5d9cbbdb2771005f4581f25a5b60c13aed1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdamThaok/capstone-milestone/git/commits/0b679b0f321422bd17f0081efe6f9a4f6db42be9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132346796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamThaok","id":132346796,"login":"AdamThaok","node_id":"U_kgDOB-NzrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamThaok/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.gi